{# Base UCR (Unified Context Review) Template #}
{# All document-specific review templates extend this base #}

# Document Review Context

## Task
Review the {{ doc_type | upper }} document for quality, completeness, and compliance with standards.

## Document Information
- **Document Type**: {{ doc_type | upper }}
- **Document ID**: {{ doc_id }}
- **Document Path**: {{ document_path }}
- **Minimum Score**: {{ min_score }}/100

## Model Configuration
- **Model**: {{ model }}

{% block validation_results %}
{% if validation_errors or validation_warnings %}
## Structural Validation Results

{% if validation_errors %}
### Errors (Must Fix)
{% for error in validation_errors %}
- {{ error }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if validation_warnings %}
### Warnings
{% for warning in validation_warnings %}
- {{ warning }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
## Structural Validation
Passed - No structural issues found.
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{% block review_criteria %}
## Review Criteria

### P0 - Critical (Blocking)
- Missing required sections
- Invalid requirement IDs
- Broken traceability
- Ambiguous requirements
- Untestable statements

### P1 - Major (Should Fix)
- Incomplete sections
- Weak acceptance criteria
- Missing cross-references
- Inconsistent terminology

### P2 - Minor (Nice to Fix)
- Formatting issues
- Typos and grammar
- Style inconsistencies
- Documentation gaps
{% endblock %}

{% block document_content %}
## Document Under Review

```markdown
{{ document_content | truncate(80000) }}
```
{% endblock %}

{% block upstream_content %}
{% if upstream_content %}
## Upstream Reference Document

```markdown
{{ upstream_content | truncate(30000) }}
```
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}

{% block instructions %}
## Review Instructions

1. **Structural Analysis**
   - Verify all required sections present
   - Check ID pattern compliance
   - Validate cross-references

2. **Content Quality**
   - Assess clarity and precision
   - Check testability of requirements
   - Verify traceability completeness

3. **Compliance Check**
   - {{ doc_type | upper }} schema compliance
   - Terminology consistency
   - Format adherence

4. **Finding Documentation**
   - Categorize by priority (P0/P1/P2)
   - Provide specific line references
   - Suggest concrete fixes
{% endblock %}

{% block output_format %}
## Output Format

Generate a structured review report in this format:

```markdown
# {{ doc_type | upper }} Review Report

## Summary
- **Score**: XX/100
- **Status**: PASSED|NEEDS_WORK|FAILED
- **P0 Findings**: X
- **P1 Findings**: X
- **P2 Findings**: X

## Findings

### P0 - Critical

#### P0-001: [Finding Title]
- **Location**: [Section/Line]
- **Issue**: [Description]
- **Impact**: [Why this matters]
- **Recommendation**: [How to fix]

### P1 - Major
[...]

### P2 - Minor
[...]

## Recommendations
1. [Priority recommendation]
2. [Next recommendation]

## Score Breakdown
| Category | Weight | Score | Weighted |
|----------|--------|-------|----------|
| Structure | 20% | XX/100 | XX |
| Content | 40% | XX/100 | XX |
| Traceability | 25% | XX/100 | XX |
| Quality | 15% | XX/100 | XX |
| **Total** | 100% | | **XX/100** |
```
{% endblock %}
